      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 12 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_10__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_10__para_a__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_10__para_a__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (1)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_10__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_10__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “forty-two days from the date of the birth or any child or” dengan perkataan “sixty days from the date of the birth of any child or fourteen days”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_10__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_10__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “subject to such conditions” dengan perkataan “subject to such fees and conditions”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_10__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) subseksyen yang berikut: “(1 a) The Registrar-General may waive, in whole or in part, the fees prescribed for late registration referred to in subsection (1) subject to such criteria and conditions as the Minister may determine.”. Pindaan seksyen 18"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_11__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_11__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 18 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_11__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “for the registration area in which the death occurred” dengan perkataan “in any registration area”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_11__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong perkataan “in duplicate in manner prescribed”. Pindaan seksyen 19"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 19(2) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “twelve hours (exclusive of the time necessary for the journey and of any intervening hours of darkness)” dengan perkataan “seven days”. Seksyen baharu 19a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 19 seksyen yang berikut: “Special provision as to registration of death 19a. Notwithstanding the provisions of this Part, the Registrar-General may, if he is satisfied from evidence adduced before him that a death had occurred, cause such death to be registered by entering in a register such particulars concerning the death.”. Pemotongan seksyen 20"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_14",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "14",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memotong seksyen 20. Pindaan seksyen 21"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_15",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "15",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_15__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_15__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_15__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 21 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_15__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_15",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menomborkan semula seksyen yang sedia ada sebagai subseksyen (1);"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_15__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_15__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_15__para_b__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_15__para_b__subpara_iii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_15",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (1) yang dinomborkan semula—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_15__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_15__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “three” dengan perkataan “seven”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_15__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_15__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong perkataan “or the period specified in section 20 whichever be the longer”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_15__para_b__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_15__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “subject to such conditions” dengan perkataan “subject to such fees and conditions”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_15__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_15",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) yang dinomborkan semula subseksyen yang berikut: “(2) The Registrar-General may waive, in whole or in part, the fees prescribed for late registration referred to in subsection (1) subject to such criteria and conditions as the Minister may determine.”. Pindaan seksyen 22"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_16",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "16",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 22(1) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “twelve hours” dengan perkataan “seven days”. Pindaan seksyen 23"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_17",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "17",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 23 Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan “twenty-four hours” dengan perkataan “seven days”. Pindaan seksyen 24"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_18",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "18",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_18__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_18__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 24 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_18__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan perkataan “twenty-four hours” dengan perkataan “seven days”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_18__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_18",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong perkataan “for the registration area within which the death took place or the body of such person was found”. Seksyen baharu 24a dan 24b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_19",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 24 seksyen yang berikut: “Registration of presumed death 24a. (1) When an order from a Court has been granted pertaining to a missing person’s presumed death under any written law, the person who has been granted the order may forward the order to the Registrar for the purpose of registering the particulars of the missing person’s presumed death. (2) On receipt of the order under subsection (1), the Registrar shall make an entry in a register containing the name of the missing person and such other information as may be necessary in relation to the missing person’s presumed death. Certificate of Presumed Death 24b. The Registrar, upon registering a missing person’s presumed death, shall issue a Certificate of Presumed Death to the person forwarding the Court order under section 24a.”. Pindaan seksyen 26"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini bolehlah dinamakan Akta Pendaftaran Kelahiran dan Kematian (Pindaan) 2016."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini mula berkuat kuasa pada tarikh yang ditetapkan oleh Menteri melalui pemberitahuan dalam Warta. Pindaan seksyen 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta Pendaftaran Kelahiran dan Kematian 1957 [Akta 299], yang disebut “Akta ibu” dalam Akta ini, dipinda dalam seksyen 2 dengan memasukkan selepas takrif “Certificate of Death” takrif yang berikut: ‘ “Certificate of Presumed Death” means a certificate issued pursuant to section 24b or subsection 32(1);’. Pindaan seksyen 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_20",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "20",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_20__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_20__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2016/15/msa@/~cl_20__para_c",
